// ┌─[ ARCH :: PACKAGE BACKUP ]──────────────────────────────┐
// │                                                         │
// └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

EXPORT
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  ep                      Export package snapshot

  Official:
    pacman.txt            Official packages

  AUR:
    aur.txt               Foreign / AUR packages

  Combined:
    all.txt               Official + AUR

  Installed:
    installed.txt         Every installed package

  Explicit:
    explicit.txt          Explicitly installed packages

  Orphans:
    orphans.txt           Unneeded dependencies


RESTORE
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  p!                      Restore official packages
  y!                      Restore AUR packages


PACKAGE DATABASE
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  pacman -Qqen            Official explicit package names
  pacman -Qqem            Foreign explicit package names
  pacman -Qdtq            Orphan package names


SNAPSHOT LOCATION
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  ~/.dotfiles/packages/
      └── <hostname>/
          └── <timestamp>/
